{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Astral Plane awaits you, <strong><i>Summoner</i>.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455290/extras/Summoner.png?t=1741565899\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey through a vast, procedurally generated world. Summon and command your army of diverse creatures to battle fearsome foes and cunning rival summoners. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of card collection and strategic play. Unleash a myriad of game-altering effects, from capturing enemy creatures, to fusing your minions together and imbuing them with synergistic traits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455290/extras/champions-vignette.png?t=1741565899\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against five formidable champions in your quest to reclaim the mystical rings they've plundered. Each victory brings you closer to ultimate power and conquering the Astral Plane.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge unstoppable warriors. Equip, enchant, combine, and mutate your creatures to create terrifyingly powerful amalgamations. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With all of this, you will form an army that tests the limits of this realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">See you in the Astral Plane, <i><strong>Summoner</strong>.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455290/extras/cudgel-dog.gif?t=1741565899\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3455290?t=1741565899","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741565899","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455290/a5bcac2e09b533dffc7f5f278b7d61962901a9e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741565899","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455290/a5bcac2e09b533dffc7f5f278b7d61962901a9e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741565899","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Cartoon Violence"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Astral Plane awaits you, <strong><i>Summoner</i>.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455290/extras/Summoner.png?t=1741565899\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey through a vast, procedurally generated world. Summon and command your army of diverse creatures to battle fearsome foes and cunning rival summoners. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of card collection and strategic play. Unleash a myriad of game-altering effects, from capturing enemy creatures, to fusing your minions together and imbuing them with synergistic traits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455290/extras/champions-vignette.png?t=1741565899\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against five formidable champions in your quest to reclaim the mystical rings they've plundered. Each victory brings you closer to ultimate power and conquering the Astral Plane.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge unstoppable warriors. Equip, enchant, combine, and mutate your creatures to create terri